From: PocketForge CI <ci@pocketforge.local>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 26/26] hw: model A133 AXP717 power key interrupt path

Route AXP717 PEK edges through the real A100 NMI register block and expose
the separate build-6 axp20x-pek device through input ABI 2.2.

Assisted-by: LLM
